      "role": "assistant",
      "reasoning": "Confirm F_net = 0. Now guide them to what this means for a vector diagram of three forces (closed loop/triangle).",
      "content": "$F_{net} = 0$ is correct.\n\nWhen three forces combine to give a net force of zero, their vector arrows, when added head-to-tail, form a specific closed shape. What geometric shape do three vectors form when they result in equilibrium?"
